# S3 fixture ("created as Excel shows it", s3-charts): a pie of one series, a slice per fruit.
# Built through Insert > Chart on the selection; Excel reads back the type and series.
sheet-name "Pie"
enter A1 "Fruit"
enter B1 "Share"
enter A2 "Apples"
enter B2 "35"
enter A3 "Pears"
enter B3 "20"
enter A4 "Plums"
enter B4 "15"
enter A5 "Cherries"
enter B5 "30"
chart A1:B5 pie
save
expect chart Pie 1 type 5 series 1
expect chart Pie 1 series 1 =SERIES(Pie!$B$1,Pie!$A$2:$A$5,Pie!$B$2:$B$5,1)
